flowchart TD
  Concept[Product name and tagline only] --> Brief[Define user, problem, behavior, privacy, MVP, and acceptance]
  Brief --> Delivery[Choose MVP to Beta to Production path]
  Delivery --> Tech[Select a technical stack after constraints are known]
  Tech --> Build[Begin implementation]
  License[GPL-3.0 in repository] --> Confirm[Confirm fit for intended commercial and distribution model]
  Confirm --> Build
  Current[Current branch: no requirements, UX, architecture, implementation, or deployment] -. scope boundary .- Concept
